t;Production design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• S1 plan: required for the &lt;b&gt;staging slot&lt;/b&gt;; deploy → test → swap = zero downtime, instant rollback&lt;br&gt;• One managed identity for both slots, so a swap never changes who talks to the data tier&lt;br&gt;• Only private (RFC 1918) traffic routes into the VNet; internet egress (Entra ID, App Insights) stays on App Service — no NAT gateway needed&lt;br&gt;• CanNotDelete locks on SQL, Storage, Key Vault (03-harden-prod.sh) · Storage ZRS · SQL backups 7 days" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="923" width="575" height="115" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c169" value="⑤ deploy" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;strokeColor=#64748B;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeWidth=1.8;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="760" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="345" y="760" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="3 Identity-security-ops" id="3 Identity-security-"><mxGraphModel dx="0" dy="0" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#0B2A4A;strokeColor=none;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="1614" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b style='font-size:30px'&gt;eURC&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="34" y="26" width="110" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;span style='font-size:12px'&gt;eURC Point of Sale (React + Node.js) · Hands-on Project 02 · Azure infrastructure architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:22px'&gt;Identity, security, monitoring and cost&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#FFFFFF;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="24" width="1100" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;span style='font-size:12px'&gt;Sheet 2 · who can do what, controls, alerts, budget&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#CFE3F7;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1274" y="30" width="340" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0B2A4A;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="1088" width="424" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#64748B'&gt;Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:11px'&gt;eURC POS · P02&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="1088" width="141" height="31" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#64748B'&gt;Drawing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:11px'&gt;EURC-P02-AZR-02&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1351" y="1088" width="141" height="31" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#64748B'&gt;Sheet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:11px'&gt;2 of 2&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1492" y="1088" width="141" height="31" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#64748B'&gt;Revision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:11px'&gt;1.1 · 2026-10-23&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="1119" width="141" height="31" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#64748B'&gt;Standard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:11px'&gt;Azure CAF naming&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1351" y="1119" width="141" height="31" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#64748B'&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:11px'&gt;A3 landscape&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1492" y="1119" width="141" height="31" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="A · Pipeline identity: OpenID Connect, no secrets (example: prod)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBF9FE;strokeColor=#5C2D91;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5C2D91;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="100" width="800" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="GitHub job" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F6F8FA;strokeColor=#24292F;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#24292F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="140" width="176" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/general/Workflow.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="178" y="146" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="cd.yml › prod&lt;br&gt;environment: &lt;b&gt;prod&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(after QA sign-off)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="46" y="168" width="162" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="GitHub OIDC token" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F6F8FA;strokeColor=#24292F;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#24292F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="234" y="140" width="176" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;span style='font-size:8.5px'&gt;iss token.actions.githubusercontent.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;sub &lt;b&gt;repo:&amp;lt;owner&amp;gt;/eurc-platform:&lt;br&gt;environment:prod&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aud api://AzureADTokenExchange" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="242" y="168" width="162" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="Federated credential" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3EEFA;strokeColor=#5C2D91;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5C2D91;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="140" width="176" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Managed_Identities.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="146" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="on &lt;b&gt;id-eurc-gh-prod-cc&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(rg-eurc-cicd-cc)&lt;br&gt;subject must match exactly" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="438" y="168" width="162" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="Entra access token" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F1FB;strokeColor=#0078D4;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0078D4;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="626" y="140" width="176" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Azure_Active_Directory.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="766" y="146" width="28" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="~1 h lifetime&lt;br&gt;scope: &lt;b&gt;rg-eurc-prod-cc&lt;/b&gt; only" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="634" y="168" width="162" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;strokeColor=#7030A0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;strokeColor=#7030A0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;strokeColor=#7030A0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;b&gt;Why one identity per environment?&lt;/b&gt; A token minted for a &lt;i&gt;dev&lt;/i&gt; job can never act on prod: the subject includes the GitHub environment, and the prod environment only runs from &lt;i&gt;main&lt;/i&gt; after a reviewer approves. Deleting a federated credential instantly cuts the pipeline off — there is no leaked secret to rotate." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="305" width="765" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="Rights: &lt;b&gt;Contributor&lt;/b&gt; on own resource group · &lt;b&gt;RBAC Administrator&lt;/b&gt; with an ABAC condition: may assign only Key Vault Secrets Officer (b86a8fe4…) and Storage Blob Data Contributor (ba92f5b4…), only to service principals." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="38" y="368" width="765" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="B · Application identity: managed identity to every data service" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBF9FE;strokeColor=#7030A0;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7030A0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="835" y="100" width="799" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/app_services/App_Services.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="210" width="44" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="web app&lt;br&gt;production + staging slots" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="827.0" y="255" width="150" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Managed_Identities.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="210" width="44" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="id-eurc-app-&amp;lt;env&amp;gt;-cc&lt;br&gt;user-assigned" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1017.0" y="255" width="150" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/databases/SQL_Database.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="135" width="40" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/security/Key_Vaults.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="222" width="40" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/storage/Storage_Accounts.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="309" width="40" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="&lt;b&gt;Azure SQL&lt;/b&gt; — identity is the server's Entra admin; Entra-only auth, no SQL logins. Runs migrations at start-up under sp_getapplock." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9.5;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1378" y="128" width="248" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c39" value="&lt;b&gt;Key Vault&lt;/b&gt; — Key Vault Secrets Officer (vault scope). Holds &lt;i&gt;pos-token-signing-key&lt;/i&gt; (HMAC key for staff sessions), created on first start." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9.5;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1378" y="215" width="248" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="&lt;b&gt;Blob&lt;/b&gt; — Storage Blob Data Contributor on container &lt;i&gt;pos-receipts&lt;/i&gt; only (receipt JSON); shared keys disabled." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9.5;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1378" y="302" width="248" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="AZURE_CLIENT_ID" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;strokeColor=#7030A0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c31" target="c33"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;strokeColor=#7030A0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c33" target="c35"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c43" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;strokeColor=#7030A0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c33" target="c36"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c44" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;strokeColor=#7030A0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c33" target="c37"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="Lab trade-off: one identity both migrates and serves. In a real production system, split a migration identity (DDL) from the runtime identity (data read/write)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9.5;align=left;fontColor=#B45309;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="372" width="470" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="C · Access matrix (least privilege)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0B2A4A;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0B2A4A;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="445" width="800" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:9.5px;font-family:Segoe UI&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;background:#0B2A4A;color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:3px 5px&quot;&gt;Principal&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;background:#0B2A4A;color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:3px 5px&quot;&gt;Scope&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;background:#0B2A4A;color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:3px 5px&quot;&gt;Role&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;background:#0B2A4A;color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:3px 5px&quot;&gt;Purpose&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Lead (GITHUB_OWNER)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;subscription · repo&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Owner · admin&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;bootstrap, backup prod approver, teardown&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F6F8FB;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Developers 1 + 2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F6F8FB;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;repository&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F6F8FB;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;write (PR only)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F6F8FB;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;branches, PRs, review each other&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Tester&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;repo · env prod&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;write · required reviewer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;owns tests/, QA sign-off&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F6F8FB;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;id-eurc-gh-dev-cc&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F6F8FB;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;rg-eurc-dev-cc&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F6F8FB;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Contributor + RBAC Admin (conditioned)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F6F8FB;border-bottom:1px solid #D5DDE8;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;dev deployments&lt;/